<title>USA: IntraNet Solutions expands dealer network.</title>
<headline>IntraNet Solutions expands dealer network.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>IntraNet Solutions Inc said Wednesday it expanded its dealer network to include two additional resellers for the Intra.doc! Management System.</p>
<p>Professional Control Corp of Milwaukee, Wis. and Intranet Solutions Software (Europe) Ltd of London will immediately begin offering the automated system for sharing and managing business information using a World Wide Web site as an access point.</p>
<p>IntraNet markets integrated software.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
